WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.638
Welcome to the Verba AI SME orientation.

00:00:03.638 --> 00:00:07.675
Carry finalized action narratives and approved PLI into Verba through

00:00:07.675 --> 00:00:09.938
explicit, auditable handoffs.

00:00:09.938 --> 00:00:13.262
Treat every queue item as a bounded specialist review.

00:00:13.262 --> 00:00:16.475
Confirm the source record and dependency state, inspect the

00:00:16.475 --> 00:00:20.450
complete worksheet or handoff, use the explicit specialist control

00:00:20.450 --> 00:00:23.038
, and verify the resulting queue state.

00:00:23.038 --> 00:00:25.625
Your decision becomes evidence for White Cell;

00:00:25.625 --> 00:00:28.625
it does not replace White Cell’s operational role.
